---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { url } from '../utils/url';
---

<Layout title="Pricing" description="Inbind is free for one. $12/person/month for teams. No lock-in.">
  <Header />

  <section class="mk-section" style="padding-top: 88px;">
    <div class="mk-container">
      <div class="mk-section-head">
        <div class="mk-section-eyebrow">Pricing</div>
        <h2 class="mk-section-h">Free for one. Reasonable for a team.</h2>
        <p class="mk-section-sub">The app itself is free and open source. Team is for shared workspaces and the AI agent that reads them.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="mk-pricing-grid">
        <!-- Free -->
        <div class="mk-price-card">
          <h3>Free</h3>
          <div class="mk-price">
            <span class="mk-price-amt">$0</span>
            <span class="mk-price-per">/ forever</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-subtle); margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px;">The full editor. Local-only. Bring your own API key for the AI panel.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Markdown editor with split, focus, and outline modes
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Git, files, and assets in the sidebar
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Wiki links and inline images
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Bring-your-own AI key (OpenAI, Anthropic, or Ollama)
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Open source on GitHub
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--ghost" href={url('download')} style="margin-top: auto;">Download free</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Team -->
        <div class="mk-price-card is-highlight">
          <span class="mk-price-card-tag">For teams</span>
          <h3>Team</h3>
          <div class="mk-price">
            <span class="mk-price-amt">$12</span>
            <span class="mk-price-per">/ person · month</span>
          </div>
          <p style="color: var(--text-subtle); margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px;">Everything in Free, plus shared brand context and our hosted AI agent.</p>
          <ul>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Shared brand voice notes that sync across the team
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Hosted AI agent. No API key juggling
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Per-workspace access controls
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              Priority support from the people who built it
            </li>
            <li>
              <svg class="mk-price-check" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <polyline points="2 8 6 12 14 4"/>
              </svg>
              30-day trial. Cancel any time
            </li>
          </ul>
          <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--primary" href="mailto:hello@inbind.app?subject=Team%20trial" style="margin-top: auto;">Start a team trial</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Honest copy block -->
      <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 72px auto 0; text-align: center;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 12px; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">What "Team" actually means</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--text-subtle); margin: 0;">
          We built Inbind because we kept losing context every time we switched tools. Team plans exist so a small group can share that context, not so we can charge for things that should be free. If you're a team of two on a tight budget, write us. We'll figure something out.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 72px auto 0;">
        <h3 style="font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 24px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-align: center;">A few honest answers</h3>

        <details class="mk-faq-item">
          <summary>Is Inbind really free?</summary>
          <p class="mk-faq-body">The desktop app is open source and free. Bring your own AI key and you'll never pay us a cent. Team is for groups that want shared context and don't want to manage keys.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="mk-faq-item">
          <summary>Where do my notes live?</summary>
          <p class="mk-faq-body">In a folder on your computer. As <code>.md</code> files. We don't have a cloud. If you put that folder in iCloud or Dropbox, it'll sync there. Up to you.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="mk-faq-item">
          <summary>Do you train on my notes?</summary>
          <p class="mk-faq-body">No. We don't see them. The Team plan routes AI calls through us, but we don't store the prompts or the responses. It's in the privacy policy.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="mk-faq-item">
          <summary>What happens to my files if I cancel?</summary>
          <p class="mk-faq-body">Nothing. They're <code>.md</code> files in a folder. Open them in any other editor. We're not the kind of tool you have to migrate out of.</p>
        </details>

        <details class="mk-faq-item">
          <summary>Is there a free trial of Team?</summary>
          <p class="mk-faq-body">30 days. No credit card up front. We'll email you the day before it ends.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>
